title: Pegboard
text: Light only runs in the gaps between the pegs. Four lasers spin a pinwheel round the board.
trick: a 4x4 grid of pegs lets beams travel and turn only on the lines between pegs; four rotated three-turn routes interlock, and the mixed dots mark where neighbours cross
motif: pictogram
expect: shared>=4
ink: 4
